# denylist.example - copy to denylist.local (gitignored) and fill in for real.
#
# One term or extended-regex pattern per line; lines starting with # are
# comments. The pre-commit hook and .githooks/content-audit.sh join these with
# | and grep case-insensitively. Put in everything that must never appear in
# this public repo: personal home paths, personal domains, internal names, and
# live-key shapes.
#
# NEVER commit the real list.
/Users/<your-username>
my-personal-domain\.example
my-internal-name
sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{16,}
sk_live_[A-Za-z0-9]+
pk_live_[A-Za-z0-9]+
